      intro: "Time is the most valuable resource in Aion 2. Players with limited daily playtime can progress just as effectively as heavy users if they optimize their time allocation. Understanding which activities deliver the most value per minute, how to structure your daily and weekly routines, and how to use AFK mechanics effectively is the difference between efficient and wasted time.",
